# 5. 여기서 너희 시스템이 생긴다

현재:

**EXCAVATE → TRANSPORT → SORT → TEST → DECIDE → REUSE**

너희 접근:

**EXCAVATE → SORT → MEASURE → RECORD → DECIDE → TRANSPORT ONLY WHERE NEEDED**

가 되는 거야.

이 차이가 매우 중요해.

### 기존

```text
Excavation Site
      ↓
 Unclassified Soil
      ↓
    TRUCK
      ↓
Central Facility
      ↓
Screen / Characterise
      ↓
Treatment
      ↓
   TRUCK
      ↓
Reuse / Disposal
```

### 너희 시스템

```text
Excavation Site
      ↓
Mobile Soil Unit
      ↓
 ┌───────────────┐
 Fine   Medium   Coarse
 └───────────────┘
      ↓
Mass / particle size /
source / test status
      ↓
Digital Material Record
      ↓
Reuse Decision
 ↙       ↓        ↘
On-site   Local     Treatment
reuse     reuse     required
```

여기에서 **분리기 자체가 innovation의 전부가 아니야.**

진짜 시스템은

> **physical separation + material characterisation + traceability + decision support**

야.

